{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119816","id":3755225870,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7f1DMO","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119816","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119816.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119816.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119816","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119816/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119816/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119816/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c83dfbfe766032d03b4e86e161a37e136f2acc3b","number":119816,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Allow showing/hiding debug collision shapes at runtime","user":{"login":"ttencate","id":90930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate","html_url":"https://github.com/ttencate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This works by propagating a newly added notification through the tree, which various physics nodes react to.\r\n\r\nIt also adds a debugger message to notify the running game of changes to the Debug > Visible Collision Shapes menu item.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2072\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11790\r\n- Supersedes #120076\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78a14bf7-29b6-410e-aa89-5373514fef8d\r\n\r\nThe embedded game turning blank is probably an artifact of my system.\r\n\r\nIt does not work on CSG nodes, but it seems like this has been broken for a while: #119812 This PR calls the right things so as soon as that bug gets fixed, it should start working here too.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.githu